          START   2552
SCOPY     LDA     ONE
          STA     TWO
          COMP    TWO
          JEQ     SCOPY
EXIT      TIX     TWELVE
          JGT     SCOPY
          LDX     TWO
          STX     ONE
          ADD     EIGHT
          SUB     SIXTY
REPLY     RESB    17
ONE       WORD    1
TWO       WORD    2
EIGHT     WORD    8
QUESTION  BYTE    C'What is your name?'
TWELVE    WORD    12
SIXTY     WORD    60
          END
